realworld.json is the RealWorld API's OpenAPI document, from
https://github.com/gothinkster/realworld (specs/api/openapi.yml, commit
ebbcdeb8d55b42a3a613c787560498b8ef10003f), converted from YAML to JSON,
under the MIT license of testdata/hurl/README. openapi_test.go compares the
app's document with it.
